    "title": {
      "en": "Kodo Mount for Alliance from Reputation in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Kodo Montura for Alliance de Reputation en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Kodo Mount for Alliance from Reputation in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Kodo Montura for Alliance de Reputation in WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab3f7c5d3f109.87688543\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Kodo mounts are typically only for Horde players, but Alliance players can get a Kodo mount in WoW: Forever!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Azeroth Commerce Authority in Forever</span></a></div><br><br>The Azeroth Commerce Authority is a brand-new reputation in WoW: Forever, but it isn't the first time we've seen this faction in a version of Classic. The Commerce Authority, along with the Durator Supply &amp; Logistics reputation for the Horde, first made their debut in Season of Discovery and played a big role in early phases.<br><br>This faction allows you to loot crates like <a class=\"q1 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=248684/waylaid-crate-apprentice-textiles\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Waylaid Crate: Apprentice Textiles\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crate_07.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Waylaid Crate: Apprentice Textiles</span></a> from around the World, fill them, and then hand them in for <a class=\"icontiny q1\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"currency\" data-entity=\"currency\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/currency=3402/merchants-favor\"><span><img alt=\"Merchant's Favor\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/racial_dwarf_findtreasure.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Merchant's Favor</span></span></a>. This currency can be spent on <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions#profession-recipes\" data-contiguous=\"true\">crafting recipes</a>, mounts, toys, and other cosmetic items.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1302754.jpg\" id=\"1302754\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1302754.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Reins of the Pack Kodo Cost\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>One of the rewards available from this faction is the <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=262766/reins-of-the-pack-kodo\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Reins of the Pack Kodo\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mount_kodo_03.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Reins of the Pack Kodo</span></a>, which is available for <a class=\"q1 tip icontinyr lazy-load-background\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"currency\" data-entity=\"currency\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/currency=3402/merchants-favor\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/racial_dwarf_findtreasure.gif&quot;);\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">6000</span></a>. The first Kodo mount available to the Alliance was the Great Brewfest Kodo during TBC, but now both factions can snag a Kodo of their very own in Forever.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Kodo mounts are typically only for Horde players, but Alliance players can get a Kodo mount in WoW: Forever!<br /><br />Azeroth Commerce Authority in Forever<br /><br />The Azeroth Commerce Authority is a brand-new reputation in WoW: Forever, but it isn't the first time we've seen this faction in a version of Classic. The Commerce Authority, along with the Durator Supply &amp; Logistics reputation for the Horde, first made their debut in Season of Discovery and played a big role in early phases.<br /><br />This faction allows you to loot crates like <a href=\"/forever/item=248684/waylaid-crate-apprentice-textiles\">Waylaid Crate: Apprentice Textiles</a> from around the World, fill them, and then hand them in for <a href=\"/forever/currency=3402/merchants-favor\">Merchant's Favor</a>. This currency can be spent on crafting recipes, mounts, toys, and other cosmetic items.<br /><br />One of the rewards available from this faction is the <a href=\"/forever/item=262766/reins-of-the-pack-kodo\">Reins of the Pack Kodo</a>, which is available for 0 <a href=\"/forever/currency=3402/merchants-favor\">Merchant's Favor</a>. The first Kodo mount available to the Alliance was the Great Brewfest Kodo during TBC, but now both factions can snag a Kodo of their very own in Forever.<br /><br /><a href=\"/forever/mount/3067\">Pack Kodo</a></noscript>            \n        ",
